1 REM FBCS GFX-0172
2 REM CLAIM A-13.5.4-15
3 REM TYPE GRAPHIC
100 PRINT "GFX-0172 TRANSFORM INSIDE A PICTURE HOLDS THE EXACT ROTATE MATRIX (13.5.4)"
110 OPTION ANGLE DEGREES
120 DIM T(4,4)
130 DECLARE PICTURE P
140 DRAW P WITH ROTATE(90)
150 DRAW P WITH ROTATE(270)
160 STOP
200 PICTURE P
210 MAT T = TRANSFORM
220 PLOT POINTS: T(1,1),T(1,2); T(2,1),T(2,2)
230 END PICTURE
999 END
